.TH pvc-preset 1  "pvc-preset " 
.SH NAME
pvc\-preset \- Manage presets (TOML files consumed by `pvc run`)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpvc\-preset\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage presets (TOML files consumed by `pvc run`)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
pvc\-preset\-init(1)
Emit an annotated default preset for a tool
.TP
pvc\-preset\-list(1)
List example presets bundled with `pvc`
.TP
pvc\-preset\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
